&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to partner across Product, Operations, Commercial, and Finance functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
