&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to translate complex analysis into concise, decision-ready insights that shape strategy and execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
