&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1242&quot;&gt;To support our continued growth, we’re seeking experienced professionals with deep wealth management industry expertise or relevant consulting backgrounds to join our team as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;Wealth &amp;amp; &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht6f867252-b930-4039-a8fa-113ca89042e8&quot;&gt;Asset Management&lt;/em&gt; Discretionary / Advisory Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
