&lt;li data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1397&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1397&quot;&gt;Design and deliver discretionary, advisory, or pooled investment propositions across multiple asset classes and client segments.&lt;/p&gt;
