&lt;p data-start=&quot;1400&quot; data-end=&quot;1498&quot;&gt;Lead strategic transformation projects, from new product launches to operational model redesign.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1499&quot; data-end=&quot;1592&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1592&quot;&gt;Partner with clients to enhance efficiency, client experience, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
