&lt;p data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;Collaborate across multi-disciplinary teams to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1682&quot; data-end=&quot;1785&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1785&quot;&gt;Contribute to practice development through mentoring, thought leadership, and internal initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
