&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across FS &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3791&quot; data-end=&quot;3891&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3893&quot; data-end=&quot;4960&quot;&gt;
